# Nucleosome group annotations

Each key used in the data files is matched to the group name used in the paper (Figures 3C and S7).

| Key             | Group name in paper            |
|-----------------|--------------------------------|
| sameYR_lowWS    | Group1_syn_YR_inphase          |
| lowYR_sameWS    | Group2_syn_SW_inphase          |
| YRWS            | Group3_syn_SYWR_inphase        |
| antiYR_antiWS   | Group4_syn_SYWR_outphase       |
| antiYR_sameWS   | Group5_anti_SRWY_inphase       |
| sameYR_antiWS   | Group6_anti_SRWY_outphase      |
| lessDNAencode   | Group7_unencoded               |

## Abbreviations
- IUPAC codes: S = G/C, W = A/T, Y = C/T, R = A/G
- YR, WS (SW): dinucleotide periodicity classes
